# Admin uploads live on a bind mount (see docker-compose.prod.yml), so the
# image never needs them. Copying them in baked a fresh snapshot of every
# uploaded photo into a new layer on EVERY rebuild — which is what filled
# the server's disk. The upload route mkdirs the folder at runtime anyway.
public/uploads
